        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo WP-34, Door Flip Guard Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Flip Guard Plate is used to protect the corner of the door for when a <a href=\"/products/automatic-release-door-flip-guard-don-jo-1606\">door flip guard arm</a> is left in the open position. The Don-Jo WP-34 Door Flip Guard Plate is easy to install, simply stick it on your door with the adhesive strip. Choose from satin chrome finish or clear.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-WP-33-specifications.gif?v=1704354741\" width=\"307\" height=\"151\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo WP-34 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Protection Guard Plate for Flip Locks:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: Adhesive Strip</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-WP-34-specifications.pdf?v=1704262340\"><b>Don-Jo WP-34 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
