                "description": "The Protection Plate is used to protect the corner of the door for when a door flip guard arm is left in the open position. The Don-Jo WP-34 Door Flip Guard Plate is easy to install, simply stick it on your door with the adhesive strip. Choose from satin chrome finish or clear.",
